              "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Fit for MeVO</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Designed with a large lumen for powerful aspiration and a full-length PTFE liner for stent retriever compatibility, AXS Vecta 46 Intermediate Catheter is a versatile solution for MeVO thrombectomy.</span></p>\n",
