              "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 27 2023 20:23:06 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Optimized large-bore delivery</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Feel confident navigating your large-bore catheter past the ophthalmic with the aid of AXS Vecta 46 Intermediate Catheter. Its .056in OD has been engineered to reduce the ledge, providing smooth and reliable catheter delivery, while its large inner lumen makes it the perfect tool for MeVO aspiration.</span></p>\n",
